        0,
        1,
        2
      ],
      "text": "One winter night in Japan, two woodcutters struggled through a snowstorm. Minokichi was eighteen; the old man was his master. When they could go no farther, they took shelter in a hut beside a river. They barred the door and lay under their straw coats. Soon the old man slept. Minokichi woke with snow brushing his face. The door stood open. A woman dressed in white was bending over his master. In the pale light, her breath flowed across the old man's face like white smoke. Then she turned. Minokichi tried to rise, but his body would not move. Her beautiful face came close to his.",
      "text_sha256": "2af037c15a3029d31d6a761bf7dd5b92ae4d38d2e70e6b5664a8dcf67c8f1b89",
      "word_count": 106,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c2",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "yuki",
      "speaker": "yuki",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:yuki",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "text": "\"I meant to kill you too,\"",
      "text_sha256": "38697d5c628bc040eaa740804ab1422fe2651ad5442e72b02c21035890c1abd2",
      "word_count": 6,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c3",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "text": "she whispered.",
      "text_sha256": "01768b2d3ccccfdf42f4c6d004db8fc5bf54ab0b586dc0a30e848aabb7ba87fb",
      "word_count": 2,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c4",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "yuki",
      "speaker": "yuki",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:yuki",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "text": "\"But you are young, so you may live. Tell anyone what you saw tonight—even your own mother—and I will know. Then I will kill you. Remember.\"",
      "text_sha256": "400bba0e27a07f02aff6f557b93cc018ec9e7892da0f0559dced9d711e2dc304",
      "word_count": 26,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c1",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        4,
        5,
        6,
        7,
        8
      ],
      "text": "She stepped out into the storm. Minokichi barred the door and touched his master's face. It was icy cold. The old man was dead. After that night, Minokichi told nobody what had happened. He kept silent even about his master's death. The next winter, on the road home, he met a beautiful girl called Yuki. Her skin was white, and her voice was gentle. He took her home to his widowed mother, who welcomed the girl and persuaded her to stay. Minokichi and Yuki married. In time they had ten fair-skinned children. The children grew, but Yuki seemed never to grow old. Years later, one evening in their home, Minokichi watched his wife sewing by the lamp. Their children were asleep, and the light lay softly on Yuki's face.",
      "text_sha256": "56a2203a57775920247cfed92b58117abc78c7c7c42216105feebc2e5a053531",
      "word_count": 129,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [
        "soft_max_exceeded(word_count=129, soft_max_words=120)"
      ],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part2_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c1",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "minokichi",
      "speaker": "minokichi",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:minokichi",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "text": "\"I once saw a woman who looked very like you,\"",
      "text_sha256": "6ae7ac0614e44cc55386290b114b777f6e017fab0854d80522735bb7ca7f5a20",
      "word_count": 10,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c2",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "text": "he said.",
      "text_sha256": "0669e82b2925c89aa39333900dd53b5eddf64c21d53190788d892d0e0af37799",
      "word_count": 2,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c3",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "yuki",
      "speaker": "yuki",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:yuki",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "text": "\"Where did you see her?\"",
      "text_sha256": "761533c034c48f790c9db0959046478262a89a5ed42b4476c42db70ced7d933d",
      "word_count": 5,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c4",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        10,
        11,
        12
      ],
      "text": "Yuki asked. Minokichi told her the whole story: the hut, his master's death, the woman's white breath, and the warning that had kept him silent. Yuki let her sewing fall. She stood and bent over him.",
      "text_sha256": "0f6eefd3e2d98a8a51aad233ecfad53b1bc380947b9810b592e942f8245f016c",
      "word_count": 36,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c5",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "yuki",
      "speaker": "yuki",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:yuki",
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "text": "\"It was me!\"",
      "text_sha256": "7118af678e6e86f64f99fb2416750808109108fa44d90e3b02a118ba39760b3a",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c5.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c6",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "text": "she cried.",
      "text_sha256": "0e5a28743fa3f584b72a47168c84d925cad0dec3602fe6c5f1b963703b2db2ca",
      "word_count": 2,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c6.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c7",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "yuki",
      "speaker": "yuki",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:yuki",
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "text": "\"I told you I would kill you if you ever said one word about it! Only those sleeping children keep me from killing you now. Take very good care of them. If they ever have reason to complain of you, I will treat you as you deserve!\"",
      "text_sha256": "f07b2e9ff0fbf88ca1fb5367e595ba247c25583dd491b131393688b174d8e8ee",
      "word_count": 47,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c7.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c8",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "text": "Her voice grew thin, like the crying of the wind. She melted into white mist, rose towards the roof beams, and slipped away through the smoke-hole. She was never seen again.",
      "text_sha256": "36b74701f7fda80e67f7a810d360a2d35931e2db2829207336dca69335d99b13",
      "word_count": 31,
      "split_reason": "article_end(直前の分割点から続く同一Voice区間)",
